module

public import StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Constructions.ProjFunctorSurjective

/-!
# Morphisms into `Proj`: the commuting square in every degree

Let `A = ⨁_{n ≥ 0} 𝒜 n` be a graded ring, `X = Proj(A)`, let `d ≥ 1` and let `U_d ⊆ X` be the
open of Equation 27.12.0.1. Let `Y` be a scheme, `L` an invertible `𝒪_Y`-module and
`ψ : A^{(d)} → Γ_*(Y, L)` a graded map whose degree-`d` values generate `L`. [Stacks, Tag 01N8]
asserts that there is a unique pair `(φ, α)` of a morphism `φ : Y ⟶ U_d` and an isomorphism
`α : φ⁎𝒪_{U_d}(d) ≅ L` such that the square

  `α ∘ φ^* ∘ ψ^d = ψ : A^{(d)} ⟶ Γ_*(Y, L)`

commutes, where `ψ^d : A^{(d)} ⟶ Γ_*(U_d, 𝒪_{U_d}(d))` is the graded map of the universal family
and `ψ^d_φ = φ^* ∘ ψ^d`. This file proves that, with the square written on the tensor powers in
every degree `n`: for `x ∈ A_{nd}`,

  `α^{⊗ n}(φ^*(ψ^d(x))) = ψ(x)` in `Γ(Y, L^{⊗ n})`.

## Main results

* `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.MorphismToProjSquare.classifyingHom_pullbackSections_universal`: the
  morphism classified by `ψ^d_φ` is `φ` itself.
* `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.MorphismToProjSquare.existsUnique_square`: there is a unique pair
  `(φ, α)` making the square commute in every degree.

## Implementation notes

The objects of the square are the library's: `ψ^d` is
`Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjDegreeOpenUniversalTriple.universalVeroneseSections`, whose
degree-`n` component reads the section of `𝒪_{U_d}(nd)` attached to `x` on the `n`-th tensor
power `𝒪_{U_d}(d)^{⊗ n}` through
`Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjTwistTensorPowDegreeOpen.thetaNat`; `φ^*` on `Γ_*` is
`Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjChartRatioPullback.pullSection`, the pullback of a section followed
by the comparison `φ^*(M^{⊗ n}) ≅ (φ^*M)^{⊗ n}`; and `α^{⊗ n}` is
`Stacks.AmplePullbackPart1.natTensorPowCongr`.

A pair `(φ, α)` makes the square commute exactly when `α` is a strict equivalence between
`φ^* ∘ ψ^d` and `ψ` in the sense of
`Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjTripleClassifying.SectionsEquiv`.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 01N8](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01N8)
* [Stacks Project, Equation 01N7](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01N7)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 01N9](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01N9)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

